:artwork_20260103_022659_722 rdf:type arto:Artwork ;
    dcterms:title "Artwork 20260103 022659 722"@en ;
    dcterms:description """A Post-Impressionism painting depicting a vibrant morning market scene. In the foreground, a medium-sized hen with warm ochre and russet brown feathers stands alert and active next to a medium-sized weathered stand painted in faded blue with honey wood accents. A single crimson rose with an emerald green stem rests fresh and vibrant on the stand's surface. Behind the stand, a large horse cart in burnt sienna and weathered gray wood and iron appears well-used but sturdy. The composition uses natural harsh morning light that creates strong shadows and highlights, with visible brushstrokes and bold color blocks characteristic of Post-Impressionism. The atmosphere feels fresh, energetic, and cheerful, with the lighting emphasizing the textures of feathers, weathered wood, iron, and delicate flower petals."""@en ;
    arto:style aat:300021502 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-01-03T02:27:35.287300"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterms:creator "AI Artwork Generation System" ;
    arto:medium arto:DigitalMedium .

